00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:38.603
If you've got a good poker face

00:00:39.372 --> 00:00:41.741
There will be something

00:00:41.741 --> 00:00:45.812
Let's head to the mountains

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:48.781
We'll just get sunburned at the sea

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:53.920
Even though it's coat season

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:58.357
He is completely misunderstanding

00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:02.595
What's going on?

00:01:02.595 --> 00:01:06.566
Being this happy

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:14.439
I'm laughing so hard I might burst

00:01:14.808 --> 00:01:22.982
I get choked up when I see his back

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:30.889
