When Lise told me that you were
chosen to be a member of Grace,

00:01:37.864 --> 00:01:39.422
I was really happy for you too.

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:42.602
To be honest, there are kids
who get into that school

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:44.593
only because their parents are influential.

00:01:45.472 --> 00:01:50.273
It gave me peace of mind knowing
that Lise had a friend like you.

00:01:50.844 --> 00:01:52.178
Well...

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:53.446
As a parent,

00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:57.584
