to remind us of our daughter.

00:02:35.922 --> 00:02:39.692
Lise Harriette Meyer

00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:44.823
was born and raised in this town, wrapped in the
love of her parents, Robert and Charlotte.

00:02:45.498 --> 00:02:47.989
She was always smiling and full of kindness.

00:02:48.902 --> 00:02:50.970
Today, we bid her farewell.

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:52.138
Diary?

00:02:52.138 --> 00:02:53.173
Yes...

00:02:53.173 --> 00:02:55.074
You exchanged diaries with Lise?

00:02:55.074 --> 00:02:56.242
I wouldn't have expected that.

00:02:56.242 --> 00:02:59.405
I thought I gave it to Lise, and
that was the end of it.

00:03:00.547 --> 00:03:04.711
But I'm not sure, maybe I do
still have it somewhere.

00:03:05.552 --> 00:03:07.577
I just can't remember.

00:03:08.788 --> 00:03:10.990
The way I way no memory of that one day...

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:13.959
It always comes back to that day. Damn...

00:03:14.294 --> 00:03:16.694
I don't know if they are related, but...

00:03:17.664 --> 00:03:19.532
