pain-in-the-ass chores like that.

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:35.381
Really?

00:03:35.381 --> 00:03:36.983
Don't say stuff like that.

00:03:36.983 --> 00:03:39.085
Hey, she was chosen to be a member of Grace.

00:03:39.085 --> 00:03:40.450
That's true, but...

00:03:41.321 --> 00:03:42.618
Look!

00:03:45.091 --> 00:03:46.558
Why in the world?

00:03:49.028 --> 00:03:50.063
It's that woman.

00:03:50.063 --> 00:03:51.364
You're kidding me.

00:03:51.364 --> 00:03:52.065
Rachel!

00:03:52.065 --> 00:03:52.699
