00:04:18.691 --> 00:04:19.892
I told you, I'm a funeral director.

00:04:19.892 --> 00:04:20.893
Don't you dare follow us to a place like this!
I told you, I'm a funeral director.

00:04:20.893 --> 00:04:22.190
