00:12:29.248 --> 00:12:30.449
Just telling a silly story about Sam.

00:12:30.449 --> 00:12:31.584
What are you talking about?!

00:12:31.584 --> 00:12:33.085
So, what are you doing tonight?

00:12:33.085 --> 00:12:34.587
