00:13:48.828 --> 00:13:51.319
You think I've got spare money laying
around to waste on movies?

00:13:54.133 --> 00:13:55.734
It must be nice being you,
having everything easy!

00:13:55.734 --> 00:13:57.503
Don't talk like that!

00:13:57.503 --> 00:13:58.370
Yuan!

00:13:58.370 --> 00:13:59.471
What?

00:13:59.471 --> 00:14:00.836
Can I have a sandwich?

00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:02.571
Here.

00:14:02.875 --> 00:14:04.240
I'd prefer one that that isn't half devoured.

00:14:06.011 --> 00:14:07.947
Okay, I'll add all this up.

00:14:07.947 --> 00:14:09.574
Okay, thanks.

00:14:12.284 --> 00:14:13.808
You're not even writing anything.

00:14:14.753 --> 00:14:15.821
Oh, sorry.

00:14:15.821 --> 00:14:18.289
You've really been spacing out a lot lately.

00:14:18.591 --> 00:14:19.925
I know.

00:14:19.925 --> 00:14:22.127
Why? Are you tired out?

00:14:22.127 --> 00:14:24.027
No, I'm sorry.

00:14:24.296 --> 00:14:26.298
Don't overdo it, okay?

00:14:26.298 --> 00:14:28.167
Why don't you just call it a day?

00:14:28.167 --> 00:14:29.657
No, I'm fine.

00:14:34.506 --> 00:14:37.304
Well, nothing's happened.

00:14:37.710 --> 00:14:39.143
You can say that again.

00:14:39.945 --> 00:14:41.580
Maybe we just need to wait a little longer.

00:14:41.580 --> 00:14:44.811
Well, I hope not too much longer.
This place is going to close up.

00:14:45.084 --> 00:14:46.719
Let's stay together a little longer.

00:14:46.719 --> 00:14:49.188
Does it even matter if we are together, or not?

00:14:49.188 --> 00:14:50.314
But...

00:14:50.456 --> 00:14:52.890
You're just scared to be alone, aren't you?

00:14:53.092 --> 00:14:56.323
Since we don't know what will happen,
we should stick together.

00:14:57.830 --> 00:14:59.422
I wish it would stop raining...

00:15:01.533 --> 00:15:03.501
I wonder if the rain is keeping that
thing from doing anything?

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:14.741
I don't get it! What if it was all a lie?

00:15:15.481 --> 00:15:18.984
But still, that guy was being that way that night...

00:15:18.984 --> 00:15:20.286
So?

00:15:20.286 --> 00:15:21.353
So...

00:15:21.353 --> 00:15:26.017
Just because we ran into some weirdo,
doesn't mean we're all dead.

00:15:26.558 --> 00:15:29.728
But what about our injuries
that healed overnight?

00:15:29.728 --> 00:15:32.720
Yes, that's strange, but it still
doesn't mean we died!

00:15:32.998 --> 00:15:34.300
Marie died.

00:15:34.300 --> 00:15:38.570
She's right. Those girls died
right before our eyes.

00:15:38.570 --> 00:15:41.835
But don't you think it's strange that they
just turned to ash after they died?

00:15:42.308 --> 00:15:44.677
I don't want to sound mean, but...

00:15:44.677 --> 00:15:45.844
It's fine.

00:15:45.844 --> 00:15:50.282
The only thing we have in common is that
we were all good friends with Lise.

00:15:50.282 --> 00:15:51.772
But I...

00:15:53.452 --> 00:15:54.680
What?

00:15:56.555 --> 00:15:58.045
Rose, what is it?

00:15:59.892 --> 00:16:04.056
I...every now and then, these
strange imaged come to me.

00:16:04.763 --> 00:16:07.197
The entrance to a house...there's a pool...

00:16:07.466 --> 00:16:10.060
and there is this strange design...

00:16:12.004 --> 00:16:15.405
Yeah, and it's a huge mansion.

00:16:15.975 --> 00:16:17.670
Yeah and there's a dog running, right?

00:16:18.711 --> 00:16:20.178
And there's a swing...

00:16:20.412 --> 00:16:22.175
But! Rachel, you too?

00:16:22.414 --> 00:16:23.608
Yeah...

00:16:24.149 --> 00:16:25.673
What the hell is going on?

00:16:45.371 --> 00:16:46.572
A butterfly...

00:16:46.572 --> 00:16:47.698
It's shining...

00:16:49.108 --> 00:16:50.405
Kate...

00:16:52.411 --> 00:16:53.708
Kate...

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:56.077
Kate...

00:16:56.148 --> 00:16:58.810
I want to start the diary over again.

00:16:59.718 --> 00:17:00.776
Lise...

00:17:01.253 --> 00:17:03.187
I know I'm the one who stopped writing in it,

00:17:03.255 --> 00:17:03.555
Lise...Lise...

00:17:03.555 --> 00:17:05.352
and you may think I'm being selfish, but...
Lise...Lise...

00:17:05.591 --> 00:17:07.354
But I want to start exchanging it again.

00:17:07.593 --> 00:17:09.395
I want you to know all about me...

00:17:09.395 --> 00:17:10.529
Lise...

00:17:10.529 --> 00:17:12.087
...as long as you're all right with it.

00:17:12.564 --> 00:17:13.588
For sure!

00:17:14.199 --> 00:17:15.496
Thanks!

00:17:16.602 --> 00:17:19.833
Great! I wrote a little bit about him also.

00:17:20.739 --> 00:17:22.036
Here it is.

00:17:32.518 --> 00:17:34.679
Is that really about her boyfriend?

00:17:35.621 --> 00:17:38.590
Yes, and this is our secret symbol.

00:17:54.773 --> 00:17:56.070
Who is it?

00:17:58.444 --> 00:17:59.741
Who is it?

00:18:00.012 --> 00:18:01.246
Let's get out of here.

00:18:01.246 --> 00:18:02.577
We need to find Lise.

00:18:17.096 --> 00:18:18.393
What a strange pool...

00:18:20.165 --> 00:18:21.462
What are you doing?

00:18:22.034 --> 00:18:23.368
There's a dog.

00:18:23.368 --> 00:18:24.665
A dog?

00:18:25.304 --> 00:18:26.601
Is this really the place?

00:18:27.306 --> 00:18:28.307
What a mansion!

00:18:28.307 --> 00:18:28.941
Where did you come from?
What a mansion!

00:18:28.941 --> 00:18:29.541
Where did you come from?
It looks like people live here.

00:18:29.541 --> 00:18:30.337
It looks like people live here.

00:18:30.909 --> 00:18:32.206
Over here!

00:18:33.178 --> 00:18:34.543
I'm in here.

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:48.257
These girls entered the mansion
without permission!

00:18:53.065 --> 00:18:54.362
What is it you plan on doing?

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:57.491
Uncle! Uncle!

00:19:06.545 --> 00:19:09.378
Stop it...Stop it...

00:20:20.586 --> 00:20:25.285
That's right, you all died that night...

00:20:26.258 --> 00:20:29.819
I...We...

00:20:30.128 --> 00:20:32.892
...at that mansion where you
went to search for Lise.

00:20:33.932 --> 00:20:37.629
My associates and I went to the mansion,
recovered your bodies,

00:20:37.936 --> 00:20:40.166
and bestowed on you this borrowed life.

00:20:42.708 --> 00:20:48.669
However, they had taken Lise away already.

00:20:50.949 --> 00:20:53.315
You girls should consider yourselves lucky.

00:20:54.019 --> 00:20:56.453
You live because we gave you life.

00:20:57.055 --> 00:20:59.046
Whether we keep you alive or kill you...

00:20:59.925 --> 00:21:02.485
is up to you.

00:21:03.262 --> 00:21:06.060
That is your fate.

00:21:07.599 --> 00:21:09.066
We...

00:21:10.802 --> 00:21:12.167
We...

00:21:13.805 --> 00:21:15.329
Really...

00:21:17.075 --> 00:21:18.599
Died...

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:30.522
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:21:30.522 --> 00:21:32.820
One, two, everybody go!

00:21:40.932 --> 00:21:43.201
The time has come! It's now! But still!

00:21:43.201 --> 00:21:45.804
It always starts with the tears in your eyes

00:21:45.804 --> 00:21:47.906
If every weighed-out day

00:21:47.906 --> 00:21:50.108
You leave feeling sick, fly high

00:21:50.108 --> 00:21:51.677
Yesterday's failures? They don't mean a thing!

00:21:51.677 --> 00:21:53.812
Tomorrow's worries? They don't mean a thing!

00:21:53.812 --> 00:21:55.947
What's always important is this moment

00:21:55.947 --> 00:21:58.541
So it goes up to the top, top, top, top

00:22:07.059 --> 00:22:08.794
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:22:08.794 --> 00:22:10.195
Gather around, my comrades

00:22:10.195 --> 00:22:11.330
If the dream you haven't had doesn't fade away

00:22:11.330 --> 00:22:13.098
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:22:13.098 --> 00:22:14.966
So don't care, babe!

00:22:14.966 --> 00:22:18.603
I'm not going to ask you the reason

00:22:18.603 --> 00:22:22.841
We'll protect you

00:22:22.841 --> 00:22:25.477
So it's okay even if they don't like you

00:22:25.477 --> 00:22:29.981
Even if they laugh at you

00:22:29.981 --> 00:22:33.018
Just keep going down that road you believe in

00:22:33.018 --> 00:22:35.620
Your tears are

00:22:35.620 --> 00:22:39.891
Two of this world's treasures beyond compare

00:22:39.891 --> 00:22:42.661
I will simply keep on singing

00:22:42.661 --> 00:22:49.801
So I won't lose it and it will reach you

00:22:49.801 --> 00:22:52.037
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:22:52.037 --> 00:22:54.139
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:22:54.139 --> 00:22:56.369
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:23:00.779 --> 00:23:03.543
They're not companions. They're not friends.

00:23:04.116 --> 00:23:06.744
At night, they fight together.

00:23:07.452 --> 00:23:10.956
Despairing of her fate, one girl will be broken.

00:23:10.956 --> 00:23:12.724
Episode #4
Where Are We Going?
Despairing of her fate, one girl will be broken.

00:23:12.724 --> 00:23:14.521
Episode #4
Where Are We Going?
